# Keep application image build contexts explicit and free of local user state.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!services/
!services/**
!fixtures/
!fixtures/**
!infra/
infra/**
!infra/cdk/
infra/cdk/**
!infra/cdk/bootstrap.py
!infra/cdk/Dockerfile.lambda
!infra/cdk/Dockerfile.runtime

# Defense in depth inside the allowed source directories.
**/.git
**/.env*
**/.local
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/cdk.out
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
